      ],
      "text": "Frequency twice per day\n\n---\n\nEffect Avathrael teleports with the effects of a 4th-rank Translocate spell, but Avathrael must begin and end the teleportation effect in an area of dim light or darkness. If they use 2 actions to activate this ability, Avathrael also regains 8d10 healing Hit Points. Avathrael can't use Shadow Step again for 1d4 rounds.",
