      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "concentrate",
        "shadow"
      ],
      "text": "Avathrael mentally reshapes their realm, reshaping terrain and creating obstacles to hinder their foes. All squares within a 50-foot burst become difficult terrain. Creatures in the area take 10d6 void damage (DC 32 basic Reflex save save) from the shadows. On a failure, that creature is additionally Grabbed by the malleable shadows (escape dc=32). At the beginning of Avathrael's turn, each creature that's grabbed takes 4d6 void damage. Avathrael can't use Shape Shadow Realm again for 1d4 rounds."
